TEs. At least there's no bullet magnetism or cover shooting. \n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1588827969, "timestamp_updated": 1588827969, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "68704054", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987820768", "personaname": "RobotTreefolk", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/robotentmoot/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 4807, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3397, "last_played": 1671334204, "avatar": "20f2323fc31c1f59195af11df6f78bff572e1e65"}, "language": "english", "review": "best multiplayer i ever played", "timestamp_created": 1588812884, "timestamp_updated": 1588812884, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "68696925", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046673244", "personaname": "gingerninja", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046673244/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5363, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4854, "last_played": 1716768182, "avatar": "0e17373023fcdb133d1a8a14f5ef09a911a20c0b"}, "language": "english", "review": ".", "timestamp_created": 1588800773, "timestamp_updated": 1588800773, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "68692736", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118935582", "personaname": "Firefly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fouroverfour/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 620, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 595, "last_played": 1588796675, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pros:\n\n1. It's fun to be a Space Marine\n2. The slow drip of new weapons and upgrades makes it fun to see how different weapons can help advance the story.\n3. Immense sense of scale\n4. Incredibly detailed models\n5. Fantastic voice acting\n6. Intense and energetic music\n\nCons:\n1. Repetitive combat system\n2. Long periods of walking through empty maps\n3. Sometimes death will come out of nowhere if you've been overwhelmed by enemies. You'll drop life fast without a clear understanding of where the damage is actually originating from. This is definitely due to how chaotic the combat can be at times.\n4. By far the worst part of the game is failing a mission and restarting at a check point that has a long walking or elevator sequence.\n5. Overall the game lacks rhyhthm and instead chooses to play the same beat over and over again.\n6. There's only 3 boss battles that I can really remember. The rest of the game is just clearing areas to progress further into the map.", "timestamp_created": 1588794986, "timestamp_updated": 1588794986, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}